56
00:02:04,655 --> 00:02:07,657
Not a problem. I got a date.

57
00:02:07,658 --> 00:02:08,721
Yeah, right.
What'd you do?

58
00:02:08,722 --> 00:02:11,716
Ask someone you met on the way
