to ask my sister out on a date.

146
00:05:43,078 --> 00:05:44,096
It's not a date.

147
00:05:44,097 --> 00:05:47,037
I just want someone to dance
with, who's nice to talk to,

148
00:05:47,038 --> 00:05:49,071
