get to know her sometime.

149
00:05:49,072 --> 00:05:51,082
She's actually pretty cool.

150
00:05:51,083 --> 00:05:54,029
Ohh. (Groans)
Make it stop.

151
00:05:56,083 --> 00:05:58,082
