The red button.

160
00:06:12,071 --> 00:06:15,045
Just push the red button.

161
00:06:15,046 --> 00:06:16,078
Got it.

162
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:17,087
(Beeping)

163
00:06:17,088 --> 00:06:19,032
Hello?

164
00:06:19,033 --> 00:06:21,000
The red button.
(Beeping continues)

165
00:06:21,001 --> 00:06:23,011
Red button, red button,
red button.

166
00:06:23,012 --> 00:06:24,083
(Beep, beeping stops, clatter)
(Sighs)

167
00:06:24,084 --> 00:06:26,074
