173
00:06:35,058 --> 00:06:36,058
I'm worried, Mike.

174
00:06:36,059 --> 00:06:38,999
She almost
set her house on fire.

175
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,065
Oh, well, then, definitely,
move her in here.

176
00:06:40,066 --> 00:06:41,083
