make out or anything.

215
00:08:08,063 --> 00:08:10,053
Ugh, yeah,
thanks for that image.

216
00:08:10,054 --> 00:08:12,088
Besides, if I was gonna
crush on any of your friends,

217
00:08:12,089 --> 00:08:15,041
it would totally be Sean.

218
